---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Journal — Y</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main>
      <header>
        <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>← 返回首页</a>

        <p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL JOURNAL</p>

        <h1>日志</h1>

        <p class="intro">
          想法、经历、日常，以及那些想留下来的文字。
        </p>
      </header>

      <section class="entries">
        <article>
          <div class="date">2026.09.15</div>

          <div>
            <div class="tag">LIFE</div>
            <h2>第一篇记录</h2>
            <p>
              这是我的个人数字档案馆的第一篇记录。
              以后这里会真正连接到数据库。
            </p>
          </div>

          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </article>

        <article>
          <div class="date">COMING SOON</div>

          <div>
            <div class="tag">THOUGHTS</div>
            <h2>更多记录</h2>
            <p>
              日记、随笔、旅行记录、人生阶段，
              都可以慢慢保存到这里。
            </p>
          </div>

          <span class="arrow">↗</span>
        </article>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: #08090c;
    color: #f3f3f0;
    font-family:
      -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Helvetica Neue", Arial,
      sans-serif;
  }

  main {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 60px 30px 100px;
  }

  header {
    padding: 40px 0 100px;
  }

  a {
    color: #9b8cff;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .tag {
    color: #8e86b5;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-top: 70px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 80px;
    letter-spacing: -4px;
    margin: 25px 0 20px;
  }

  .intro {
    color: #85868d;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .entries {
    border-top: 1px solid #292a30;
  }

  article {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 160px 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
    padding: 45px 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #292a30;
    transition: background 0.3s ease;
  }

  article:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.025);
  }

  .date {
    color: #5f6068;
    font-family: monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 12px 0;
    font-size: 28px;
  }

  article p {
    max-width: 600px;
    color: #777880;
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .arrow {
    position: absolute;
    right: 20px;
    top: 45px;
    color: #66676e;
    font-size: 20px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    main {
      padding: 40px 20px 80px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 60px;
    }

    article {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 15px;
    }
  }
</style>